     "who": "interpreter",
     "speaker": "翻译",
     "lang": "zhNorth",
     "subtitle": "恁呢？说！后沟有多少人？机枪架哪儿了？",
     "text": "恁呢？说！后沟有多少人？机枪架哪儿了？",
     "file": "./Audio/Blockout0105/AudioVoice_Blockout0105Interrogation_05.mp3",
